Subject: [PATCH] Molten Core: casters hold on a Majordomo add with Magic Reflection

WHY THIS PATCH EXISTS

Every 30 seconds Majordomo Executus casts either Magic Reflection (20619) or
Damage Shield (21075) on himself and the adds around him. While an add carries
Magic Reflection, a spell a caster aims at it comes back at the caster. The
moltencore strategy only keeps damage off Majordomo himself, so casters keep
casting into a reflecting Flamewaker Healer (11663) or Flamewaker Elite (11664)
and are killed by their own spells. This is patch 1 of 4 for the encounter.

WHAT IT DOES

For a caster's damage target selection, an add that carries Magic Reflection
is excluded in the same hook that already excludes Majordomo. The caster then
takes another add that is not reflecting, or has no target and waits until the
aura drops. When a caster holds, one line is logged at most every three
seconds for the whole raid:

    [MC] majordomo: N casters holding, magic reflection on <add>

WHAT THIS PATCH DELIBERATELY DOES NOT DO

It does not touch melee or tanks (Damage Shield is patch 2), the kill order
(patch 3) or the threat after Teleport Target (patch 4). It keys on the aura by
spell id on the two add entries only, so no other encounter is affected.

WHEN THIS PATCH SHOULD BE DELETED

When the fork's Molten Core strategy keeps casters off a reflecting target
itself.

diff --git a/src/Ai/Raid/MC/MCHelpers.h b/src/Ai/Raid/MC/MCHelpers.h
index 0c90fcd..932a974 100644
--- a/src/Ai/Raid/MC/MCHelpers.h
+++ b/src/Ai/Raid/MC/MCHelpers.h
@@ -16,6 +16,8 @@ enum MoltenCoreNPCs
 
     // Majordomo Executus
     NPC_MAJORDOMO_EXECUTUS = 12018,
+    NPC_FLAMEWAKER_HEALER = 11663,
+    NPC_FLAMEWAKER_ELITE = 11664,
 
     // Core Hound (trash)
     NPC_CORE_HOUND = 11671,
@@ -29,6 +31,10 @@ enum MoltenCoreSpells
     // Golemagg
     SPELL_GOLEMAGGS_TRUST = 20553,
     SPELL_MAGMA_SPLASH = 13880,
+
+    // Majordomo Executus: every 30s he casts this on himself and the adds
+    // around him
+    SPELL_MAGIC_REFLECTION = 20619,
 };
 
 constexpr uint32 MAGMA_SPLASH_BACK_OFF_STACKS = 20;
diff --git a/src/Ai/Raid/MC/MCStrategy.cpp b/src/Ai/Raid/MC/MCStrategy.cpp
index 2584b9f..a50da55 100644
--- a/src/Ai/Raid/MC/MCStrategy.cpp
+++ b/src/Ai/Raid/MC/MCStrategy.cpp
@@ -116,6 +116,12 @@ void RaidMcStrategy::AppendTargetExclusions(GuidSet& exclusions, TargetValueExcl
     // through their own target selection.
     AiObjectContext* context = botAI->GetAiObjectContext();
     bool const golemaggAlive = AI_VALUE2(Unit*, "find target", "golemagg the incinerator") != nullptr;
+    // Magic Reflection returns a caster's own spell to the caster. Casters
+    // leave a reflecting add alone: they take another add that is not
+    // reflecting, or they have no target and wait until the aura drops.
+    Player* bot = botAI->GetBot();
+    bool const casterHolds = type == TargetValueExclusionType::Dps && PlayerbotAI::IsCaster(bot);
+    Unit* reflecting = nullptr;
     for (ObjectGuid const guid : AI_VALUE(GuidVector, "attackers"))
     {
         Unit* unit = botAI->GetUnit(guid);
@@ -124,5 +130,30 @@ void RaidMcStrategy::AppendTargetExclusions(GuidSet& exclusions, TargetValueExcl
 
         if ((golemaggAlive && unit->GetEntry() == NPC_CORE_RAGER) || unit->GetEntry() == NPC_MAJORDOMO_EXECUTUS)
             exclusions.insert(guid);
+        else if (casterHolds && unit->HasAura(SPELL_MAGIC_REFLECTION) &&
+                 (unit->GetEntry() == NPC_FLAMEWAKER_HEALER || unit->GetEntry() == NPC_FLAMEWAKER_ELITE))
+        {
+            exclusions.insert(guid);
+            reflecting = unit;
+        }
+    }
+
+    if (reflecting)
+    {
+        // One line per few seconds for the whole raid, not one per bot per tick.
+        static uint32 lastLogMs = 0;
+        uint32 const nowMs = getMSTime();
+        if (getMSTimeDiff(lastLogMs, nowMs) >= 3000)
+        {
+            lastLogMs = nowMs;
+            uint32 holding = 0;
+            if (Group* group = bot->GetGroup())
+                for (GroupReference* itr = group->GetFirstMember(); itr != nullptr; itr = itr->next())
+                    if (Player* member = itr->GetSource())
+                        if (member->IsAlive() && PlayerbotAI::IsCaster(member))
+                            ++holding;
+            LOG_INFO("playerbots", "[MC] majordomo: {} casters holding, magic reflection on {}", holding,
+                     reflecting->GetName());
+        }
     }
 }
